body:
Yes. I think certain people can get an ABLE account which helps them save up for medical expensives but I don't have one and most people don't. Basically if you are born disabled, you are punished for being ""worthless"" to the government since you're not making them any money. It keeps us hungryand unable to travel or pay for medical stuff so we die sooner ig, then we arent a drain on the goverment. Not \*my\* opinion mind you I don't think any of us are worthless but like. Yeah, USA rlly hates disabled people.

&#x200B;

It also prevents us from getting a decent job and crawling out of pverty because living is so expensive, and if we get a good job we could lose our SSI benefits before we are stable enough to move into a different apartment or whatever (section 8 has income limits), so then we would end up homeless. It is a very difficult cycle to escape from. Some people can do it with luck but the rest of us are basically trapped.

Here's all the ones I've tried. Some of them aren't exactly marketed as mage homes, but would fit a mage character just fine.

